#   using tools like pyenv, to pin the version.
# .python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in git.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if used with a poweruser, this lock file is useful
#   to lock down exact requirements.
#Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, poetry.lock is custom to Poetry and should be tracked in git.
#poetry.lock

# pdm
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, pdm.lock is custom to PDM and should be tracked in git.
#pdm.lock

